{"work_id":"manohara","scene_id":"manohara-s035","scene_ordinal":35,"transition_audit_id":"T035","source_scene_number":null,"source_scene_file":"works/manohara/scenes/scene-035.md","record_count":13,"records":[{"id":"manohara-s035-d001","scene_id":"manohara-s035","scene_ordinal":35,"transition_audit_id":"T035","speaker_label":"மனோ","speaker_delimiter":":","text":"மாதா சிறை செல்ல வேண்டும்... மனோகரன் மன்னிப்புக் கேட்கவேண்டும்!","page_provenance":[{"pdf_page":48,"printed_page":47}],"source_scene_file":"scene-035.md"},{"id":"manohara-s035-d002","scene_id":"manohara-s035","scene_ordinal":35,"transition_audit_id":"T035","speaker_label":"ராஜப்பிரியன்","speaker_delimiter":":","text":"அதுவும் கொலு மண்டபத்தில்; அந்தக் குப்பை மேட்டுக் கோட்டானிடம்!","page_provenance":[{"pdf_page":48,"printed_page":47}],"source_scene_file":"scene-035.md"},{"id":"manohara-s035-d003","scene_id":"manohara-s035","scene_ordinal":35,"transition_audit_id":"T035","speaker_label":"மனோ","speaker_delimiter":":","text":"ஆணையிடுவது தந்தை!","page_provenance":[{"pdf_page":48,"printed_page":47}],"source_scene_file":"scene-035.md"},{"id":"manohara-s035-d004","scene_id":"manohara-s035","scene_ordinal":35,"transition_audit_id":"T035","speaker_label":"பத்","speaker_delimiter":":","text":"ஆமாம் கண்ணே! அதை மறந்துவிடாதே, உன்னைப் பெற்ற தந்தை.","page_provenance":[{"pdf_page":48,"printed_page":47}],"source_scene_file":"scene-035.md"},{"id":"manohara-s035-d005","scene_id":"manohara-s035","scene_ordinal":35,"transition_audit_id":"T035","speaker_label":"ராஜப்","speaker_delimiter":":","text":"தந்தை...அஞ்சா நெஞ்சனை மகனாகப் பெற்றார்... அருங்குணவதியை மனைவியாகப் பெற்றார்... அவர் பெற மறந்தது ஒன்றுண்டு, தாயே! அறிவு! அறிவு! அதைத் தான் பெற மறந்தார்!","page_provenance":[{"pdf_page":48,"printed_page":47}],"source_scene_file":"scene-035.md"},{"id":"manohara-s035-d006","scene_id":"manohara-s035","scene_ordinal":35,"transition_audit_id":"T035","speaker_label":"மனோ","speaker_delimiter":":","text":"மறந்ததை நினைவூட்டுகிறேன்...","page_provenance":[{"pdf_page":48,"printed_page":47}],"source_scene_file":"scene-035.md"},{"id":"manohara-s035-d007","scene_id":"manohara-s035","scene_ordinal":35,"transition_audit_id":"T035","speaker_label":"பத்","speaker_delimiter":":","text":"உன்னால் முடியாது என்று சொல்கிறேன் தங்கமே! அவசரத்தில் அப்பா தவறியிருக்கலாம்...எதற்கும் நீ போய் காரணம் கேள்!","page_provenance":[{"pdf_page":48,"printed_page":47}],"source_scene_file":"scene-035.md"},{"id":"manohara-s035-d008","scene_id":"manohara-s035","scene_ordinal":35,"transition_audit_id":"T035","speaker_label":"மனோ","speaker_delimiter":":","text":"காரணம் கேட்பதா?","page_provenance":[{"pdf_page":48,"printed_page":47}],"source_scene_file":"scene-035.md"},{"id":"manohara-s035-d009","scene_id":"manohara-s035","scene_ordinal":35,"transition_audit_id":"T035","speaker_label":"விஜயா","speaker_delimiter":":","text":"அத்தே...வேண்டாம்... அவரை அனுப்பாதீர்கள்...வேண்டாம் அத்தே...அனுப்பாதீர்கள்...வேண்டாம் அத்தே...அதுதான் நீங்கள் போக வேண்டாம்...","page_provenance":[{"pdf_page":48,"printed_page":47}],"source_scene_file":"scene-035.md"},{"id":"manohara-s035-d010","scene_id":"manohara-s035","scene_ordinal":35,"transition_audit_id":"T035","speaker_label":"பத்","speaker_delimiter":":","text":"வீரமகனே...போய்வா...","page_provenance":[{"pdf_page":48,"printed_page":47}],"source_scene_file":"scene-035.md"},{"id":"manohara-s035-d011","scene_id":"manohara-s035","scene_ordinal":35,"transition_audit_id":"T035","speaker_label":"விஜ","speaker_delimiter":":","text":"வேண்டாம் அத்தே!","page_provenance":[{"pdf_page":48,"printed_page":47}],"source_scene_file":"scene-035.md"},{"id":"manohara-s035-d012","scene_id":"manohara-s035","scene_ordinal":35,"transition_audit_id":"T035","speaker_label":"பத்","speaker_delimiter":":","text":"விஜயா!","page_provenance":[{"pdf_page":48,"printed_page":47}],"source_scene_file":"scene-035.md"},{"id":"manohara-s035-d013","scene_id":"manohara-s035","scene_ordinal":35,"transition_audit_id":"T035","speaker_label":"மனோ","speaker_delimiter":":","text":"போய் வருகிறேன் [பத்மாவதியைக் கைது செய்ய வந்திருக்கும் சிப்பாய்களை நோக்கி] ஜாக்ரதை! நான் திரும்பும் வரையில் நெருங்கக்கூடாது, என் அன்னையிடம்...\n[விஜயாவை நோக்கி]\nவிஜயா! பார்த்துக்கொள்...வருகிறேன்","page_provenance":[{"pdf_page":48,"printed_page":47}],"source_scene_file":"scene-035.md"}]}